BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 678 Tm (1. Read superblock feature masks before interpreting a volume. Incompatible,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 661.5 Tm (read-only-compatible and compatible features have different consequences for safe access.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 635 Tm (2. Resolve flexible block-group and 64-bit descriptor layouts from explicit flags;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 618.5 Tm (fixed-size classic ext2 descriptor assumptions can misaddress bitmaps or inode tables.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 592 Tm (3. Parse extent headers by magic, depth, entry count and capacity. Follow indexed extent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 575.5 Tm (nodes until leaf records map logical file blocks to physical ranges.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 549 Tm (4. Distinguish initialized extents from unwritten allocated extents; newly reserved space) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 532.5 Tm (need not expose existing disk contents as file data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 506 Tm (5. Check delayed-allocation effects when interpreting an unclean image. In-memory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 489.5 Tm (allocation plans are not necessarily represented by committed on-disk extents.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 463 Tm (6. Read HTree-indexed directories through their index records while still validating) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 446.5 Tm (actual variable-length directory entries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 420 Tm (7. Handle JBD2 journal records in big-endian form even though ext4 metadata is generally) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 403.5 Tm (little-endian; confusing their byte order breaks recovery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 377 Tm (8. Validate metadata checksums using the correct feature-dependent checksum seed, UUID) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 360.5 Tm (and structure coverage, not a generic whole-sector CRC.) Tj ET
